# Keep executable shell scripts and GitHub workflow definitions portable when
# the repository is checked out on Windows and executed through Git Bash.
*.sh text eol=lf
# The published launcher keeps its shebang working when packed on Windows:
# a CRLF checkout would break `#!/usr/bin/env node` on Linux/macOS.
# (Exec bits of bin/sa itself are restored at runtime by the launcher's
# fs.chmodSync, so no gitattributes needed for staged binaries.)
npm/packages/sa/bin/sa.js text eol=lf
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf
.github/workflows/*.yaml text eol=lf
